 "remarks": "Welcome to Orchard Lakes, this beautiful detached home has an open, airy floor plan with vaulted ceiling and atrium windows allowing for abundant natural light throughout. The combination living room/dining room has a fireplace and hardwood floors, opens to a wrap-around deck. The kitchen is well designed with an eat-in area and also opens to the deck. The primary bedroom on the main level has a walk-in closet and large bath. The upper level has two additional bedrooms and a bath. The spacious lower level is finished with full bath and has additional unfinished storage space. A detached two-car garage is adjacent to the unit. Orchard Lakes consists of 32 dwellings and sits on 14.6 acres of professionally landscaped land featuring woodlands, pond, waterfalls, and scenic walking trails with mature trees and flowering plants. It is located on the north side of New Canaan Avenue and is conveniently located to the Merritt Parkway, I-95 Connector and Metro North.",
